        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur WINWIN-DB, Windsor Decorative Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis ornately styled deadbolt from Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware is not just fashionable, it offers great security. Forged from solid brass, it has a 1\" deadbolt with a hardened steel core and the door strike is reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security. Available as single cylinder (keyed lock on the outside with thumb turn inside) or a double cylinder (keyed lock on both outside and inside). It features a low profile lock cylinder projection (only 0.66\"). Easy to install the Windsor Decorative Deadbolt fits doors 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-windsor-series\"><b>Windsor Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur WINWIN-DB Windsor Decorative Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur WINWIN-DB Windsor Decorative Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Height: 4.20\"</li>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.55\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur Deadbolt Exploded View (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WIN-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Windsor Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
